{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37342","headline":"任潜谋隐之作 · 唐彦谦","name":"任潜谋隐之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江边秋日逢任子，大理索诗吾欲忘。\n爲问山资何次第，祗余丹诀转凄凉。\n黄金范蠡曾辞禄，白首虞翻未信方。\n千古浮云共归思，晓风城郭水花香。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37342.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37342","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}